# draw-order pins for options-over-mainmenu (1280x720, options slide-in settled).
# the options panel spans x=82..709; the mainmenu logo (mikosu's placeholder wordmark, white #f5f5f5 letters on a
# transparent face) sits centered and pulses to wall-clock music, so both points sit 7+ px inside a letter stroke
# (picked by scanning a capture for the largest uniform patch).
# options row background above the menu logo at the overlap point: the "o" of the wordmark, dimmed by the panel
# (if the base screen ever draws above the overlay band, this reads the logo's #f5f5f5 instead)
0.5117 0.5167 212121 8
# solid logo interior peeking right of the panel edge (the "u") = the base still draws beneath
0.6219 0.5153 f5f5f5 8
